{"title":"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 12B Problems\">2003 AMC 12B #6</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems\">2003 AMC 10B #8</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The second and fourth terms of a geometric sequence are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Which of the following is a possible first term?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/9/f9922c06a32ecd2479568060e245858446cc6180.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } -\\sqrt{3}  \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } -\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3} \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } -\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3} \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } \\sqrt{3} \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"497\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the first term be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and the common ratio be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. Therefore, \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/d/d6da05e8becb6457c46753fab5b6c95676cb5de6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ar=2\\ \\ (1) \\qquad \\text{and} \\qquad ar^3=6\\ \\ (2)\\]\" width=\"270\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Dividing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> eliminates the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, yielding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/6/616b9e90ab61c407d0eb624b8d9bb616659f1b6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^2=3$\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/0/5a03242fde0a17ff38e0a70594afc1a0863af2b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=\\pm\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Now, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/9/a796f649d15c3f70c05ed2ffcd17c6a3ec5bfdde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ar=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/e/1be550f35afc30ac0c8519b247bd13b70e024491.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\frac{2}{r}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"45\" height=\"37\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/d/a0d7d66cea92bebe0efc6fb54bb75d34f794be4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\frac{2}{\\pm\\sqrt{3}}=\\pm\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"154\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p>We therefore see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/5/fe5cb9b6dab641e23c26dfa87c265c1566d2102e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ -\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"105\" height=\"53\" /> is a possible first term.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B\">2003 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2003 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a